{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103080","id":2347503590,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6L7A_m","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103080","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103080.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103080.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103080","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103080/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103080/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103080/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/ee0cebeaad9d80d43e954c202032e85d72dc38fb","number":103080,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix `modified_time` on Android","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes: #101007 (Workaround)\r\n\r\n**Issue Description:**\r\nAfter saving, all timestamps (`st_mtime, st_ctime, st_atime`) are set to the same value.\r\nAfter exporting or after some time, only `modified_time` resets to a past timestamp.\r\n\r\nCache files are created during export and rely on `modified_time`.\r\n\r\n**Workaround:**\r\nUse `created_time` if `modified_time` is in the past.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-------\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101007#issuecomment-2670335154\r\nI initially suspected `thirdparty/minizip/unzip.c` because the timestamps were only reset after `unz*` functions. However, this behavior also occurs when no export is performed, once even when the Godot Editor was not running (terminated).\r\n\r\n<details><summary>Test</summary>\r\n\r\n--------\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b534990a-7fe0-4232-a164-e1eb2ed15dc3\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details><summary>timestamp check after export</summary>\r\n\r\n---------\r\n\r\n\r\nAfter saving the time was still 16:xx and after export it was reset to 15:xx.\r\n\r\n![timestamp_bug](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a950ddb4-e0ff-41b5-9600-6ec0a0f36db8)\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471795,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE3OTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:thirdparty","name":"topic:thirdparty","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2909900850,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyOTA5OTAwODUw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:export","name":"topic:export","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":10558797,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AoR1N","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/20","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20/labels","number":20,"state":"closed","title":"4.4","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":8,"closed_issues":4466,"created_at":"2024-02-14T11:52:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T23:48:31Z","closed_at":"2025-03-19T09:35:35Z","due_on":"2025-03-03T00:00:00Z"},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-02-20T15:58:28Z","updated_at":"2025-02-24T17:23:02Z","closed_at":"2025-02-20T19:08:20Z","merged_at":"2025-02-20T19:08:19Z","merge_commit_sha":"5c0b0e99243c53ae538d42616ba04383ffb4b45a","as